05:46.621 --> 06:00.611
[SPEAKER_00]: Now because of this, and actually because, uh, your mother, for whatever reason, um, seemed to really love the guy that was your father.

06:02.252 --> 06:05.935
[SPEAKER_00]: Uh, never took another

06:07.500 --> 06:09.121
[SPEAKER_00]: Present in this scene, Paul.

06:26.313 --> 06:35.297
[SPEAKER_00]: In the Isles, which he could have made alliances with the Commodores of the Outer Islands or even some of the, you know, princes from bigger cities.

06:36.658 --> 06:39.279
[SPEAKER_00]: For one, he never really wanted to subject your mother to that.

06:39.599 --> 06:45.301
[SPEAKER_00]: You know this about him because these are rough men and he wanted to keep her inside the city.

06:46.062 --> 06:51.924
[SPEAKER_00]: He could have married her to a merchant or even some noble from another country, but because of her

07:00.181 --> 07:04.343
