07:11.907 --> 07:13.327
[SPEAKER_00]: And she never remarried.

07:13.708 --> 07:13.968
[SPEAKER_00]: Right?

07:14.988 --> 07:15.288
[SPEAKER_00]: Now...

07:15.789 --> 07:16.929
[SPEAKER_00]: Interesting.

07:23.432 --> 07:28.855
[SPEAKER_01]: You, however... You were always adored by your mother.

07:30.319 --> 07:32.180
[SPEAKER_01]: She pretty much... Am I an only child?

