07:34.141 --> 07:34.442
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay.

07:35.382 --> 07:35.782
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

07:38.844 --> 07:40.906
[SPEAKER_00]: You always remember your mother there.

07:40.926 --> 07:43.327
[SPEAKER_00]: You always remember her loving you dearly, right?

07:45.048 --> 07:50.332
