09:56.711 --> 09:56.931
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay.

09:57.031 --> 10:00.292
[SPEAKER_00]: And the reason you wear a leather mask is because it's not as heavy as a metal one.

10:00.832 --> 10:01.052
