10:01.592 --> 10:02.172
[SPEAKER_00]: And it's quieter.

10:02.733 --> 10:03.873
[SPEAKER_00]: It's quieter.

10:05.893 --> 10:11.434
[SPEAKER_00]: And when you're in the castle, everybody kind of recognizes that and understands it, okay?

10:11.594 --> 10:20.916
[SPEAKER_00]: But also, you wear clothing that covers up your body because you don't want people to see your skin.

10:22.257 --> 10:23.277
