11:00.037 --> 11:05.622
[SPEAKER_00]: It can kind of get in the way of your concentration sometimes, especially when it's hot and you're having to wear leathers.

11:06.142 --> 11:20.074
[SPEAKER_00]: Oftentimes you'll retreat to your private chambers to be able to strip off the clothes you wear and wash yourself because, you know, wearing these confining clothes is horrible, right?

11:21.979 --> 11:29.502
