11:39.325 --> 11:44.847
[SPEAKER_00]: Which is basically your back, which is fairly undamaged, the backs of your legs.

11:45.447 --> 11:49.149
[SPEAKER_00]: Most of the damage happens to your front, but your head,

11:50.949 --> 12:03.174
[SPEAKER_00]: You don't really have a memory of what happened, but rumors have abounded and you've learned some of these through the years.

12:05.234 --> 12:06.835
