12:58.175 --> 12:58.595
[SPEAKER_00]: However...

13:00.242 --> 13:05.125
[SPEAKER_00]: Monmurg is a very, very cosmopolitan city, and so there is magic.

13:05.605 --> 13:17.172
[SPEAKER_00]: I mean, there are street vendors that sell potions, there are street vendors that sell charms, there are head wizards all over the place, and, of course, the

13:20.402 --> 13:30.527
