14:11.888 --> 14:14.350
[SPEAKER_00]: Prince Jeon the Second.

14:15.330 --> 14:22.596
[SPEAKER_00]: He is like the first among equals of the princes and without a doubt the most, probably the wealthiest man.

14:25.028 --> 14:32.633
