15:24.529 --> 15:26.450
[SPEAKER_00]: Then the Azur Sea protects

15:28.290 --> 15:31.592
[SPEAKER_00]: The Monmurgian sea principalities.

15:32.892 --> 15:39.695
[SPEAKER_00]: Coastal lands, because the navy there can fight off any kind of naval attack from Keoland, absolutely.

15:43.436 --> 15:56.261
[SPEAKER_00]: Anyway, so this has kind of been your life, and in fact, because of

15:57.555 --> 16:25.906
[SPEAKER_00]: Your disfigurement, also because of your mother's coddling, and you know this about yourself, you have never been given the kind of responsibilities or duties that somebody who is this closely related to the Prince of Monmurg

