17:20.548 --> 17:42.873
[SPEAKER_00]: I mean, that's what's so amazing about the, the, um, uh, uh, Prince Jeon and your, your family is that they were a group of pirates who were very successful, but they really quickly understood that to be able to maintain their power, they needed to have an administration and a, um,

17:47.010 --> 18:09.823
