21:25.433 --> 21:29.474
[SPEAKER_01]: So I'm on my own majority of the time, is what you're saying.

21:31.074 --> 21:33.735
[SPEAKER_01]: Well... Just because no one wants to be around me.

21:33.935 --> 21:34.575
